{
 "chunk": 40,
 "cat": "jar",
 "items": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "It's likely that you will have to overcome some automated defenses first.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "Make sure you have enough fuel to make the trip successfully.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "Recover at least %s ships at Tetra",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "Retrieve AI core from derelict probe beyond the orbit of Pontus",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "Return to Ancyra and contact ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "Return to Ancyra and report your success",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "Sneak into ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "Stabilize the inner-system jump-point",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "The Derinkuyu leadership will surely soon be toppled by rank-and-file miners eager to get on the right side of the law once again.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "There's a Domain-era survey probe outside the orbit of Pontus. If salvaged, it's likely to yield a gamma AI core, which should be sufficient for the task.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "Use %s to avoid detection, and %s to get away if you are seen.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "Use the hyperwave sequence produced by the AI core to stabilize the inner-system jump-point.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "en": "You have delivered the report and your standing with the Hegemony has increased substantially.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "en": "You receive a tight-beam communication from the system's main inhabited world, Ancyra.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "en": "You will have to defeat the pirates guarding it first.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "en": "detailing the recent events to the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "en": "to acquire the raw jump-point readings.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialMissionIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "en": "A pirate fleet is approaching! First you'll spot it as a sensor contact, then as an unidentified fleet, and then - when it gets very close - you'll see its true colors.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialPirateApproachesDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "en": "Don't worry - the pirate ship is a shoddy rust bucket, and if you do lose, you can press %s to quick-load.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialPirateApproachesDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "en": "Even so, combat can be expensive, especially if there's no bounty on the enemy you fight. Deploying ships into battle reduces their combat readiness, and recovering CR consumes supplies. Battle damage can cost even more supplies to repair.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialPirateApproachesDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "en": "However, fighting is often necessary to survive. Wait for the pirate fleet to approach, then defeat them!",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialPirateApproachesDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "en": "Exit to main menu",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialRespawnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "en": "Load last save",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialRespawnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "en": " is pretty far away, and it'll take a while to get there at this rate.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialSustainedBurnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "en": " more quickly.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialSustainedBurnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "en": "Activate %s to get to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialSustainedBurnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "en": "The %s ability is useful for long-distance travel. Activating it will briefly stop the fleet and reduce its acceleration to a minimum, but the maximum burn level will be much higher. A sustained burn can be interrupted by other fleets activating an interdiction pulse.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialSustainedBurnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "en": "You can also press and hold %s to speed up time.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialSustainedBurnDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "en": ", both to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "en": ", which is controlled by the Hegemony - ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "en": "Activate the %s before getting closer to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "en": "Keeping your transponder on is a crippling disadvantage in hostile space, but as we're getting closer to port and we'd like to dock there, it's a good idea to turn it on.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "en": "Since turning it on and off has major consequences, it requires a double-tap to turn on or off - once to prime, and once more to confirm.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "en": "Turning on the transponder makes your fleet highly visible, and everyone seeing it will know who you are - unlike that pirate fleet you fought earlier, which had to be very close to positively identify.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "en": "While in Hegemony space, a fleet is required by law to identify itself by keeping its transponder turned on. This is a view shared by most, though not all, major factions.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "en": "Your fleet is getting closer to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "en": "a major militaristic faction in the Sector.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "en": "avoid unwanted attention from patrols and to receive docking clearance.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "en": "double-tap",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialTransponderDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "en": "Fortunately, there's a debris field nearby. Move up into it and activate your %s ability to search it for useful cargo.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "en": "If you don't acquire more supplies, your fleet will suffer through a slow but ultimately fatal decline.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "en": "Make sure to take all of the supplies and any other valuable cargo, but feel free to leave the cheap and bulky metals behind.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "en": "Scavenging requires Heavy Machinery, but there is some in your cargo holds.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "en": "To get your fleet moving, click on empty space in the direction you want to move.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "en": "Welcome to the Persean Sector! Your fleet is in the middle of nowhere and critically low on supplies.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/tutorial/TutorialWelcomeDialogPluginImpl.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "en": "Entering slipstream",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamEntityPlugin.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "en": "Fleets traveling inside a slipstream use %s less fuel for the distance covered.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "en": "In addition, traveling at burn levels above %s is even more fuel-efficient. For example, a fleet traveling at burn %s will consume half as much fuel for the distance it covers.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "en": "Inside slipstream",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "en": "Most slipstreams are temporary, and in recent memory their ebb and flow has been unusually synchronized with the standard Domain cycle.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "en": "These fuel use reductions are not reflected by the fuel range indicator on the map.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "en": "half",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/velfield/SlipstreamTerrainPlugin2.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "en": "Automated Mining Station",
